[00:00.61]Lesson 121 | 第121课
[00:04.03]The man in a hat | 戴帽子的男人
[00:07.26]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.92]Why didn't Caroline recognize the customer straight away? | 卡罗琳为什么没有马上认出那个顾客?
[00:20.48]I bought two expensive dictionaries here half an hour ago, but I forgot to take them with me. | 半小时前我在这里买了两本很贵的词典,但我忘了带走。
[00:30.67]Who served you, sir? | 先生,是谁接待您的?
[00:33.51]The lady who is standing behind the counter. | 就是站在柜台后面的那位女士。
[00:37.82]Which books did you buy? | 您买了哪些书?
[00:41.15]The books which are on the counter. | 就是柜台上的那些书。
[00:44.96]Did you serve this gentleman half an hour ago, Caroline? | 卡罗琳,半小时前是你接待了这位先生吗?
[00:50.19]He says he's the man who bought these books. | 他说他就是买了这些书的那个人。
[00:54.75]I can't remember. | 我想不起来了。
[00:57.50]The man who I served was wearing a hat. | 我接待的那个人戴着一顶帽子。
[01:02.54]Have you got a hat, sir? | 先生,您有帽子吗?
[01:05.92]Yes, I have. | 是的,我有。
[01:08.15]Would you put it on, please? | 请您戴上好吗?
[01:10.91]All right. | 好的。
[01:12.71]Is this the man that you served, Caroline? | 卡罗琳,这就是你接待的那个人吗?
[01:17.10]Yes. | 是的。
[01:18.31]I recognize him now. | 我现在认出他了。